+| code-burler-review, code-burler-fix | 9 + 7 | The same sentences as the other burlers. | 3.9 of 19.9 and 4.1 + 0.3 of 28.6; 2.0 and 2.2 | 19% and 13% + 1%; 9.5% and 7% |
